sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant C as Client app
  participant S as Auth server
  U->>C: Enter credentials
  C->>S: POST /login
  alt credentials valid
    S-->>C: 200 + access token
    C-->>U: Dashboard
  else invalid
    S-->>C: 401 unauthorized
    C-->>U: Error banner
  end
